    ("A standard 12-coin balance-scale puzzle asks: you have 12 identical-looking coins, one of which is heavier OR lighter (unknown which). Using a two-pan balance, what is the minimum weighings guaranteed to identify the counterfeit AND its weight direction?", "3 weighings", ["2 weighings", "4 weighings", "5 weighings"], "24 possible outcomes vs. 3³ = 27 ternary outcomes on a 3-state balance scale."),
