    ("In normal-play Nim with piles of sizes 1, 2, and 3, who wins with optimal play?", "Second player", ["First player", "Always a draw", "Depends on who takes pile 3"], "1 ⊕ 2 ⊕ 3 = 0, which is a P-position (losing for the player to move)."),
    ("In a 2-player unbiased coin-tossing duel, Alice wins if she flips Heads before Bob, taking turns starting with Alice. What is Alice's win probability?", "2/3", ["1/2", "3/4", "5/8"], "P = 1/2 + (1/2)(1/2)P = 1/2 + P/4, giving (3/4)P = 1/2 -> P = 2/3."),
